#. Tag: title
#: emboss.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "Emboss Image"
msgstr " ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​រូបភាព​ក្រឡោត"

#. Tag: author
#: emboss.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
